The '''Battle of the Contested Field''' (14 June 1250) was fought between the
Kingdom of Varra under Aldric and the Duchy of Selm under Berengar. The ducal
army left the field at dusk and Varra held the ground the next morning.

== The battle ==

Aldric kept his cavalry in reserve until the ducal line wavered.

